sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Writer
    participant B as Branch
    participant A as Auditor
    participant M as Main
    participant C as Consumer
    C->>M: reads snapshot
    W->>B: writes new data
    A->>B: runs checks
    alt checks pass
        A->>M: fast-forward commit
        C->>M: sees new snapshot
    else checks fail
        A--xB: branch kept
        Note over M,C: main unchanged
    end
